# Regression test for Guarded thunk state-restoration fix.
# A TypeAssert-annotated recursive function should produce E040 (DepthExceeded)
# not E070 (CircularDependency). With the old bug, the Guarded thunk would get
# stuck in InProgress after DepthExceeded, causing the next access to see a
# spurious CircularDependency error.
[f: [fn [x] [@Int [call $f [call $+ $x 1]]]]
 result: [call $f 0]]
===
=== ERROR: [E040]
